#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "Delete pattern space.  Start next cycle."
msgstr "Radera mönsterutrymmet. Starta nästa cykel."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "D"
msgstr "D"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"If pattern space contains no newline, start a normal new cycle as if the d "
"command was issued.  Otherwise, delete text in the pattern space up to the "
"first newline, and restart cycle with the resultant pattern space, without "
"reading a new line of input."
msgstr ""
"Om mönsterutrymmet inte innehåller någon nyrad, starta en normal ny cykel "
"som om kommandot d avgavs. Annars, radera text i mönsterutrymmet fram till "
"den första nyraden, och starta om en cykel med det resulterande "
"mönsterutrymmet, utan att läsa en ny rad från indata."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "h H"
msgstr "h H"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "Copy/append pattern space to hold space."
msgstr "Kopiera/lägg till mönsterutrymmet till lastutrymmet."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "g G"
msgstr "g G"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "Copy/append hold space to pattern space."
msgstr "Kopiera/lägg till lastutrymmet till mönsterutrymmet."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "l"
msgstr "l"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "List out the current line in a ``visually unambiguous'' form."
msgstr "Skriv ut den aktuella raden på ett ''visuellt otvetydigt'' format."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "l\\ I<width>"
msgstr "l\\ I<bredd>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"List out the current line in a ``visually unambiguous'' form, breaking it at "
"I<width> characters.  This is a GNU extension."
msgstr ""
"Skriv ut den aktuella raden på ett ''visuellt otvetydigt'' format, med "
"radbrytning vid I<bredd> tecken. Detta är en GNU-utvidgning."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "n N"
msgstr "n N"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "Read/append the next line of input into the pattern space."
msgstr "Läs/lägg till nästa rad av indata in i mönsterutrymmet."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "p"
msgstr "p"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "Print the current pattern space."
msgstr "Skriv ut det nuvarande mönsterutrymmet."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "P"
msgstr "P"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "Print up to the first embedded newline of the current pattern space."
msgstr ""
"Skriv ut fram till den första inbäddade nyraden i det nuvarande "
"mönsterutrymmet."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "s/I<regexp>/I<replacement>/"
msgstr "s/I<reguttr>/I<ersättning>/"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"Attempt to match I<regexp> against the pattern space.  If successful, "
"replace that portion matched with I<replacement>.  The I<replacement> may "
"contain the special character B<&> to refer to that portion of the pattern "
"space which matched, and the special escapes \\e1 through \\e9 to refer to "
"the corresponding matching sub-expressions in the I<regexp>."
msgstr ""
"Försök att matcha I<reguttr> mot mönsterutrymmet. Om det lyckas, ersätt då "
"den delen som matchas med I<ersättning>. I<Ersättningen> kan innehålla det "
"speciella tecknet B<&> för att referera till den delen av mönsterutrymmet "
"som matchade, och de speciella styrsekvenserna \\e1 till \\e9 för att "
"referera till motsvarande deluttryck i I<reguttr>."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "t\\ I<label>"
msgstr "t\\ I<etikett>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"If a s/// has done a successful substitution since the last input line was "
"read and since the last t or T command, then branch to I<label>; if I<label> "
"is omitted, branch to end of script."
msgstr ""
"Om ett s/// har gjort en lyckad substitution sedan den senaste indataraden "
"lästes och sedan det senaste t- eller T-kommandot, grena i så fall till "
"I<etikett>; om I<etikett> utelämnas, grena till slutet av skriptet."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "T\\ I<label>"
msgstr "T\\ I<etikett>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"If no s/// has done a successful substitution since the last input line was "
"read and since the last t or T command, then branch to I<label>; if I<label> "
"is omitted, branch to end of script.  This is a GNU extension."
msgstr ""
"Om inget s/// har gjort en lyckad substitution sedan den senaste indataraden "
"lästes och sedan det senaste t- eller T-kommandot, grena i så fall till "
"I<etikett>; om I<etikett> utelämnas, grena till slutet av skriptet. Detta är "
"en GNU-utvidgning."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "w\\ I<filename>"
msgstr "w\\ I<filnamn>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "Write the current pattern space to I<filename>."
msgstr "Skriv ut det nuvarande mönsterutrymmet till I<filnamn>."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "W\\ I<filename>"
msgstr "W\\ I<filnamn>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"Write the first line of the current pattern space to I<filename>.  This is a "
"GNU extension."
msgstr ""
"Skriv den första raden i det nuvarande mönsterutrymmet till I<filnamn>. "
"Detta är en GNU-utvidgning."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "x"
msgstr "x"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "Exchange the contents of the hold and pattern spaces."
msgstr "Byt ut innehållen mellan last- och mönsterutrymmena."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "y/I<source>/I<dest>/"
msgstr "y/I<källa>/I<dest>/"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"Transliterate the characters in the pattern space which appear in I<source> "
"to the corresponding character in I<dest>."
msgstr ""
"Transliterera tecknen i mönsterutrymmet som förekommer i I<källa> till "
"motsvarande tecken i I<dest>."

#. type: SH
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "Addresses"
msgstr "Adresser"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"\\*(Sd commands can be given with no addresses, in which case the command "
"will be executed for all input lines; with one address, in which case the "
"command will only be executed for input lines which match that address; or "
"with two addresses, in which case the command will be executed for all input "
"lines which match the inclusive range of lines starting from the first "
"address and continuing to the second address.  Three things to note about "
"address ranges: the syntax is I<addr1>,I<addr2> (i.e., the addresses are "
"separated by a comma); the line which I<addr1> matched will always be "
"accepted, even if I<addr2> selects an earlier line; and if I<addr2> is a "
"I<regexp>, it will not be tested against the line that I<addr1> matched."
msgstr ""
"\\*(Sd-kommandon kan ges utan adresser, då kommandot kommer köras på alla "
"indatarader; med en adress, då kommandot bara kommer köras på indatarader "
"som matchar den adressen; eller med två adresser, då kommandot kommer köras "
"på alla indatarader som matchar det slutna intervallet av rader som börjar "
"från den första adressen och fortsätter till den andra adressen. Tre saker "
"att notera om adressintervall: syntaxen är I<adr1>,I<adr2> (d.v.s., "
"adresserna separeras med ett komma); raden som I<adr1> matchade kommer "
"alltid accepteras, även om I<adr2> väljer en tidigare rad; och om I<adr2> är "
"ett I<reguttr> kommer det inte att testas mot raden som I<adr1> matchade."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"After the address (or address-range), and before the command, a B<!> may be "
"inserted, which specifies that the command shall only be executed if the "
"address (or address-range) does B<not> match."
msgstr ""
"Efter att adressen (eller adressintervallet), och före kommandot, kan ett B<!"
"> infogas, vilket anger att kommandot bara skall köras om adressen (eller "
"adressintervallet) B<inte> matchar."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "The following address types are supported:"
msgstr "Följande adresstyper stödjs:"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "I<number>"
msgstr "I<nummer>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"Match only the specified line I<number> (which increments cumulatively "
"across files, unless the B<-s> option is specified on the command line)."
msgstr ""
"Matcha endast den angivna raden I<nummer> (vilket ökas successivt mellan "
"filer, om inte flaggan B<-s> anges på kommandoraden)."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "I<first>~I<step>"
msgstr "I<första>~I<steg>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"Match every I<step>'th line starting with line I<first>.  For example, ``sed "
"-n 1~2p'' will print all the odd-numbered lines in the input stream, and the "
"address 2~5 will match every fifth line, starting with the second.  I<first> "
"can be zero; in this case, \\*(sd operates as if it were equal to I<step>.  "
"(This is an extension.)"
msgstr ""
"Matcha var I<steg>:e rad med början på rad I<första>. Till exempel, ''sed -n "
"1~2p'' kommer skriva ut alla rader med udda nummer i indataströmmen, och "
"adressen 2~5 kommer matcha var femte rad, med början på den andra. I<Första> "
"kan vara noll; i så fall arbetar \\*(sd som om den var lika med I<steg>. "
"(Detta är en utvidgning.)"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "$"
msgstr "$"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "Match the last line."
msgstr "Matcha den sista raden."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "/I<regexp>/"
msgstr "/I<reguttr>/"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"Match lines matching the regular expression I<regexp>.  Matching is "
"performed on the current pattern space, which can be modified with commands "
"such as ``s///''."
msgstr ""
"Matcha rader som matchar det reguljära uttrycket I<reguttr>. Matchningen "
"utförs på det nuvarande mönsterutrymmet, vilket kan modifieras med kommandon "
"som ''s///''."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "\\eB<c>I<regexp>B<c>"
msgstr "\\eB<c>I<reguttr>B<c>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"Match lines matching the regular expression I<regexp>.  The B<c> may be any "
"character."
msgstr ""
"Matcha rader som matchar det reguljära uttrycket I<reguttr>. B<c> kan vara "
"godtyckligt tecken."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "GNU \\*(sd also supports some special 2-address forms:"
msgstr "GNU \\*(sd stödjer även några speciella 2-adressformer:"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "0,I<addr2>"
msgstr "0,I<adr2>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"Start out in \"matched first address\" state, until I<addr2> is found.  This "
"is similar to 1,I<addr2>, except that if I<addr2> matches the very first "
"line of input the 0,I<addr2> form will be at the end of its range, whereas "
"the 1,I<addr2> form will still be at the beginning of its range.  This works "
"only when I<addr2> is a regular expression."
msgstr ""
"Starta i tillståndet ”matchade första adressen”, tills I<adr2> hittas. Detta "
"liknar 1,I<adr2>, med undantaget att om I<adr2> matchar den allra första "
"indataraden kommer 0,I<adr2> vara vid slutet av sitt intervall, medan formen "
"1,I<adr2> fortfarande kommer vara i början av sitt intervall. Detta fungerar "
"endast när I<adr2> är ett reguljärt uttryck."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "I<addr1>,+I<N>"
msgstr "I<adr1>,+I<N>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "Will match I<addr1> and the I<N> lines following I<addr1>."
msgstr "Kommer matcha I<adr1> och de I<N> följande raderna efter I<adr1>."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "I<addr1>,~I<N>"
msgstr "I<adr1>,~I<N>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"Will match I<addr1> and the lines following I<addr1> until the next line "
"whose input line number is a multiple of I<N>."
msgstr ""
"Kommer matcha I<adr1> och raderna som följer efter I<adr1> till nästa rad "
"vars indataradnummer är en multipel av I<N>."

#. type: SH
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "REGULAR EXPRESSIONS"
msgstr "REGULJÄRA UTTRYCK"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"POSIX.2 BREs I<should> be supported, but they aren't completely because of "
"performance problems.  The B<\\en> sequence in a regular expression matches "
"the newline character, and similarly for B<\\ea>, B<\\et>, and other "
"sequences.  The I<-E> option switches to using extended regular expressions "
"instead; it has been supported for years by GNU sed, and is now included in "
"POSIX."
msgstr ""
"POSIX.2 BRE:er I<skulle> stödjas, men det görs inte fullständigt på grund av "
"prestandaproblem. Sekvensen B<\\en> i ett reguljärt uttryck matchar "
"nyradstecknet, och liknande för B<\\ea>, B<\\et>, och andra sekvenser. "
"Flaggan I<-E> byter till att använda utökade reguljära uttryck istället; den "
"har stötts i åratal av GNU sed, och är nu inkluderat i POSIX."

#. type: SH
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "BUGS"
msgstr "FEL"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"E-mail bug reports to B<bug-sed@gnu.org>.  Also, please include the output "
"of ``sed --version'' in the body of your report if at all possible."
msgstr ""
"E-posta felrapporter till B<bug-sed@gnu.org>. Inkludera gärna även utdata "
"från ''sed --version'' i kroppen av din rapport om möjligt. E-posta "
"anmärkningar på översättningen till B<tp-sv@listor.tp-sv.se>."

#. type: SH
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "AUTHOR"
msgstr "UPPHOVSMAN"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"Written by Jay Fenlason, Tom Lord, Ken Pizzini, Paolo Bonzini, Jim Meyering, "
"and Assaf Gordon."
msgstr ""
"Skrivet av Jay Fenlason, Tom Lord, Ken Pizzini, Paolo Bonzini, Jim Meyering "
"och Assaf Gordon."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux mageia-cauldron
msgid "This sed program was built without SELinux support."
msgstr "Detta sed-program byggdes utan stöd för SELinux."

